# Cloudflare Pages custom headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# Served from the root of the build output (dist/_headers), copied from public/.
#
# IMPORTANT: Do not put Content-Security-Policy or COOP on `/*` — Pages merges every matching rule,
# so `/assets/*` would inherit them on `.js` responses and WebKit breaks foliate blob iframes (live smoke).
# Document headers apply only to HTML shell routes below.
#
# CSP rationale (blueprint 11, 12.2, 14, 17):
#   default-src 'self'            no third-party origin anywhere; fonts, icons and all code are self-hosted
#   script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'   Vite bundles; WebAssembly (pdf.js, ONNX Runtime Web) must compile. No inline scripts, no eval.
#   worker-src 'self' blob:       Comlink workers are bundled files; blob: covers libraries that spawn blob workers
#   style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' blob:  Radix and e-book iframes inject <style> elements; the e-book engine links blob: stylesheets; no external CSS
#   img-src 'self' blob: data:    covers and book images are object URLs / data URIs from OPFS
#   media-src 'self' blob:        the single <audio> element plays object URLs created from OPFS files
#   font-src 'self'               Inter, Literata etc. are self-hosted woff2
#   connect-src 'self' blob: data: plus approved model hosts (scripts/audit-allowlist.json; DECISIONS.md phase 4)
#   frame-src 'self' blob:        foliate-js renders book sections in blob: iframes
#   manifest-src 'self'           web app manifest
#   object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'   (the Web Share Target POSTs to /share-target on this origin)
#   X-Frame-Options: DENY (below) blocks embedding; omit frame-ancestors in CSP so WebKit can load blob: EPUB iframes (live smoke)

/
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' blob:; img-src 'self' blob: data:; media-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' blob: data: https://huggingface.co https://*.huggingface.co https://*.hf.co; frame-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), hid=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cache-Control: no-cache

